{"nodes": [{"id": "doxygen_documentation_manuals_parsers_yaml_schema_fsisph_model_sph_model_schema", "label": "FSI-SPH model YAML schema", "file_type": "document", "source_file": "doxygen/documentation/manuals/parsers/YAML_schema_fsisph_model.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "doxygen_documentation_manuals_parsers_yaml_schema_fsisph_model_physics_problem", "label": "physics_problem: CFD vs CRM", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "doxygen/documentation/manuals/parsers/YAML_schema_fsisph_model.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "One SPH machinery serves two physics: incompressible fluid (CFD, parameterized by fluid_properties) and homogenized granular dynamics (CRM, parameterized by soil_properties with a mu(I) friction law), so the choice of property block follows from this single enum."}, {"id": "doxygen_documentation_manuals_parsers_yaml_schema_fsisph_model_fluid_domain", "label": "fluid_domain and container", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "doxygen/documentation/manuals/parsers/YAML_schema_fsisph_model.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Same property set for the initially filled region and the confining container, shaped by geometry_type (CARTESIAN box vs CYLINDRICAL annulus). Walls may be declared on the fluid domain OR on a container but not both - declaring a container after fluid_domain already declared walls is an error, which keeps a single unambiguous owner of the boundary."}, {"id": "doxygen_documentation_manuals_parsers_yaml_schema_fsisph_model_computational_domain", "label": "computational_domain and BC types", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "doxygen/documentation/manuals/parsers/YAML_schema_fsisph_model.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "AABB bounding the region in which particles are tracked, with per-direction NONE/PERIODIC/INLET_OUTLET boundary conditions. For CARTESIAN geometry a non-NONE BC requires that no fluid-domain wall was defined normal to that direction, since a solid wall and a periodic/inlet-outlet boundary in the same direction would conflict."}, {"id": "doxygen_documentation_manuals_parsers_yaml_schema_fsisph_model_wave_tank", "label": "wave_tank shorthand", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "doxygen/documentation/manuals/parsers/YAML_schema_fsisph_model.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Self-contained alternative to explicit domain definitions: when present, fluid_domain, container and computational_domain are all ignored. Restricted to physics_problem CFD and CARTESIAN geometry, and drives a PISTON or FLAP wave maker through a generic time function with an optional delay."}, {"id": "doxygen_documentation_manuals_parsers_yaml_schema_fsisph_model_initial_states", "label": "SPH initial_states (depth-based pressure)", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "doxygen/documentation/manuals/parsers/YAML_schema_fsisph_model.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Initializes particle pressure hydrostatically from depth relative to zero_height, which suppresses the startup transient a zero-pressure initialization would produce."}], "edges": [{"source": "doxygen_documentation_manuals_parsers_yaml_schema_fsisph_model_sph_model_schema", "target": "doxygen_documentation_manuals_parsers_yaml_schema_fsisph_model_physics_problem", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "doxygen/documentation/manuals/parsers/YAML_schema_fsisph_model.md", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "doxygen_documentation_manuals_parsers_yaml_schema_fsisph_model_sph_model_schema", "target": "doxygen_documentation_manuals_parsers_yaml_schema_fsisph_model_fluid_domain", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "doxygen/documentation/manuals/parsers/YAML_schema_fsisph_model.md", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "doxygen_documentation_manuals_parsers_yaml_schema_fsisph_model_sph_model_schema", "target": "doxygen_documentation_manuals_parsers_yaml_schema_fsisph_model_computational_domain", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "doxygen/documentation/manuals/parsers/YAML_schema_fsisph_model.md", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "doxygen_documentation_manuals_parsers_yaml_schema_fsisph_model_sph_model_schema", "target": "doxygen_documentation_manuals_parsers_yaml_schema_fsisph_model_wave_tank", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "doxygen/documentation/manuals/parsers/YAML_schema_fsisph_model.md", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "doxygen_documentation_manuals_parsers_yaml_schema_fsisph_model_sph_model_schema", "target": "doxygen_documentation_manuals_parsers_yaml_schema_fsisph_model_initial_states", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "doxygen/documentation/manuals/parsers/YAML_schema_fsisph_model.md", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "doxygen_documentation_manuals_parsers_yaml_schema_fsisph_model_wave_tank", "target": "doxygen_documentation_manuals_parsers_yaml_schema_fsisph_model_fluid_domain", "relation": "conceptually_related_to", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "doxygen/documentation/manuals/parsers/YAML_schema_fsisph_model.md", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "doxygen_documentation_manuals_parsers_yaml_schema_fsisph_model_wave_tank", "target": "doxyge